diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index a4f72aa..077ec26 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -267,6 +267,183 @@
   interpreter and the generated MSL/GLSL/WGSL, and bind the stage that
   `texm3x2tex` samples: the sampler mask counted only `tex`/`texldl`, so on
   Metal it sampled black. Fixes #20.
+- Map equal GDI window/viewport extents with saturated integer translation,
+  avoiding per-pixel software long-double arithmetic in browser raster draws.
+  Copy opaque 32-bit DIBs directly into separate window surfaces for SRCCOPY,
+  preserving clipping, source bounds and orientation. Keep other raster
+  operations and scaled coordinate mappings on the general paths. Optional
+  `RECOMP_IMPORT_TIMING=1` reports cumulative inclusive wall times for completed
+  imports every five seconds; nested callbacks and waits are included.
+
+- Show a keyboard focus hint in browser players. Diagnose host key transitions
+  and the first key-state query in each state with `RECOMP_TRACE_KEYS=1`.
+
+- Build Android x86_64 APKs with `--android-abi x86_64` for native emulator
+  testing. Keep their CMake and Gradle output separate from ARM64, and package
+  the configured ABI rather than silently labeling every library ARM64.
+
+- Use legacy single-subpass Vulkan render passes when dynamic rendering is not
+  supported or enabled. Retain framebuffers until command completion and retire
+  them before referenced image views. `RECOMP_VULKAN_LEGACY_RENDER_PASSES=1`
+  selects this path for verification on newer devices. The separate Direct3D 9
+  Vulkan encoder still requires dynamic rendering and uses its CPU fallback on
+  these devices.
+  Make the copied Android game directory traversable by the app after an adb
+  data push; preserve the app's enclosing scoped-storage root permissions.
+
+- Retrieve pending window paint before generated SetTimer notifications in both
+  PeekMessage and GetMessage. Preserve explicitly posted WM_TIMER order, message
+  filters and PM_NOREMOVE behavior.
+  Queue simultaneously expired timers by their deadline instead of window handle
+  and timer ID, including DWORD clock wrap.
+  Trace dispatched window message arguments through `RECOMP_TRACE_MESSAGES=1`.
+
+- Allow verbose subsystem diagnostics with import traffic suppressed through
+  `RECOMP_TRACE_IMPORTS=0`, and include string resource IDs in LoadString traces.
+  Include bounded guest stack samples in exception traces and optional ReadFile
+  byte samples through `RECOMP_TRACE_FILE_BYTES=1`.
+  Sample guest frame arguments at a selected SEH prologue through
+  `RECOMP_TRACE_SEH_AT=<hex address>`.
+
+- Emit live exception checkpoints for SEH prologues that push a proven register
+  copy of FS:[0], including Visual Basic and MSVC frames; reject mutated copies
+  and alternate entries that bypass the load.
+  Retire unlinked records before the local stack is popped, and move surviving
+  checkpoints onto the resumable driver after a generated activation returns.
+  Reset profiling ownership when a checkpoint moves to its new host activation.
+  Preserve unchanged generated source timestamps for incremental native builds.
+  Complete the owning callback when guest exception recovery restores an older
+  callback stack directly, retiring abandoned handlers and exception records.
+
+- Deliver ANSI SetWindowText through WM_SETTEXT so controls update their text,
+  notify their parent and repaint, matching the Unicode entry point.
+  Implement GetWindowTextA through WM_GETTEXT with ANSI/Unicode conversion.
+
+- Place newly created child windows below existing siblings and clip shared GDI
+  surfaces against higher siblings when requested by WS_CLIPSIBLINGS, including
+  siblings that cover an ancestor control.
+
+- Enable the available Android Vulkan surface extension, and give Gradle the
+  native build's NDK so its APK symbol stripping uses the matching toolchain.
+
+- Separate queued keyboard presses from their matching releases by a guest turn,
+  matching the mouse batching rule so fast taps remain observable to polling code.
+
+- Retain retrieved mouse-message button states for GetKeyState so a quick
+  physical release cannot erase the press a windowless control is processing.
+  GetAsyncKeyState still reports current host input, and focus loss clears snapshots.
+
+- Resolve the Android Gradle wrapper from the staged project so Windows-hosted
+  APK assembly can start when the caller runs outside that directory.
+
+- Package the host's General MIDI bank and notice for web and Android targets;
+  unpack named Android runtime resources without pruning profiles or game data.
+
+- Apply an audited patch to fetched SDL PulseAudio source so playback request
+  accounting remains under the callback's lock instead of losing concurrent updates.
+
+- Rebuild and retry an out-of-date Vulkan swapchain once within acquisition,
+  avoiding a presenter fault for a recoverable window resize.
+
+- Resolve absolute Windows drive and UNC developer game paths directly,
+  including packaged diagnostics launched outside a checkout.
+
+- Allow an explicit RECOMP_HOST_SECONDS diagnostic limit to close a desktop
+  run through the guest window message path after exercising the real devices.
+
+- Bundle LLVM-MinGW's shared C++ runtimes and notices in Windows desktop
+  packages so the app does not depend on the compiler's PATH.
+
+- Add an offline MCI score fixture that accepts private SMF files and verifies
+  sequencer note delivery and nonzero synth output without an audio device.
+
+- Preserve host-supplied keyboard characters through TranslateMessage without
+  queuing a duplicate character for the retrieved key message.
+
+- Crop positive-height StretchDIBits source rectangles from the lower-left origin
+  of bottom-up DIBs, preserving top-down source coordinates.
+
+- Keep the writable profile tier active when RECOMP_NO_MODS disables plugins.
+- Honor background erase requests during BeginPaint, use the window class brush,
+  and repaint the exposed parent when a child window is hidden.
+- Clip paints to accumulated update rectangles and keep hidden child DCs from
+  reading or drawing in their visible parent's surface.
+
+- Convert GetDIBits into the requested true-colour depth, row orientation and
+  scan range, preventing raw internal rows from overwriting smaller buffers.
+
+- Finish translated helper continuations inside generated callback ABI adapters
+  when resumable guest stacks are enabled.
+
+- Compare ANSI library names without case using portable Windows-1252 letter
+  folding. Linguistic sort ordering remains unimplemented.
+- Open legacy files through the guest overlay, including bare-name search,
+  OFSTRUCT paths, parse/existence queries and reopening recorded paths.
+- Read legacy registry default values, including subkey queries, size queries
+  and empty defaults, through the profile registry.
+- Expose Boolean SetPixelV with the shared transformed and clipped pixel writer.
+- Play basic MCI sequencer command strings through the shared MIDI synth and
+  SMF decoder, with quoted guest paths, aliases, stop/close and status queries.
+  Reserve the synth for one MIDI client and reject unsupported commands/flags.
+
+- Activate mapped native COM class factories through the shared guest DLL
+  lifecycle. Format task-owned GUID strings and support streams backed by
+  global memory, including clone ownership and backing-handle growth.
+
+- Play file-backed and in-memory PCM WAV effects through the shared host audio
+  service, including synchronous waits, asynchronous loops and stop/NOSTOP.
+
+- Provide system ListBox item storage, selection and parent notifications,
+  and Edit text, selection, replacement, typing limits, read-only state and undo.
+
+- Supply transient OLE storage and owned streams with reads, writes, 64-bit
+  seeks, cloning, CopyTo and parent-lifetime invalidation. Reject persistent
+  compound files and unsupported transactions without returning false success.
+- Measure ANSI text through the same selected-font backend as UTF-16 text.
+
+- Render plain ANSI text and anisotropic OLE picture blits. Route pure GDI
+  desktop input in screen coordinates, and clamp Boolean button check states.
+- Support legacy file reads/seeks/closes and guest-overlay path searches.
+- Allow smoke scripts to run profiles without built-in entity/counter globals.
+
+- Share ANSI and UTF-16 window-class queries, clipboard formats, global atoms,
+  and mapped-module string resources. Load resource icons and bitmaps through
+  the existing guest GDI image model, including requested image dimensions.
+- Expose the COM task allocator with a guest IMalloc vtable, shared task-memory
+  ownership, per-thread message filter registration, and OLE Automation's
+  documented ordinal aliases and BSTR string entry points.
+- Support binary BSTR byte counts, separately allocated SAFEARRAY descriptors
+  and data, and transfer the ownership of thread-local Automation error objects.
+- Track nested SAFEARRAY data-access locks and reject unbalanced releases.
+- Bind the legacy Automation thread-setup compatibility export CoSetState.
+- Share ANSI and wide font objects with correctly sized LOGFONT queries and
+  selected-face names, including Windows-1252 conversion.
+- Decode ANSI resource icons into inspectable, drawable pixels with their AND
+  transparency mask. Add logical pen creation and per-window context-help IDs.
+- Provide system button painting, check states and pointer/keyboard click
+  notifications for framework subclasses; share ANSI window properties.
+- Delegate COM disconnection to custom marshalers and preserve their reference
+  ownership. Bind shutdown APIs without launching an unsupported help viewer.
+
+- Bind mapped DLL imports after all configured export tables are visible, and
+  initialize static DLL dependencies before entering their caller.
+- Decode the structured memory operands of x87 environment and register saves.
+- Recover distant switch arms and preserve taken branches across listing gaps;
+  recognize split returning epilogues before inferring calls that never return.
+- Discover callback addresses stored directly into memory fields.
+- Preserve interface adjustors whose shared method body has its own vtable entry.
+- Retain explicit branch targets that are intentional debugger breakpoints,
+  while continuing to exclude unrelated INT3 padding.
+- Translate indexed interface dispatchers that consume their CALL return
+  address, and apply the interpreter-disable setting to unknown tail jumps.
+- Preserve storage-medium ownership, compatible bitmap dimensions and DDB/DIB
+  layouts, and consume byte-sized icon arguments according to their ABI.
+- Adapt complete generated lazy-interface and object-getter callback templates
+  to translated methods, preserving HRESULT cleanup and COM reference ownership.
+- Add ANSI extended text output, update-region queries and Boolean region
+  operations whose complex coverage retains holes in GDI clipping.
+- Allow static ports to disable runtime instruction interpretation with
+  `[translate] allow_runtime_interpreter = false`.
 
 - Allow native game adapters to place their own cursors at absolute touch
   positions in logical game pixels. Placement can discard pending DirectInput
